### Tone: The first real question, after someone cut the intro short. Mock confidence: they skipped the briefing.
### A skip can come at any point (during her hello, the roll call, the rules or the example), and a short intro has no
### rules at all: don't say what they missed. Don't name anyone: a vote may have skipped it.

